{
  "manifestVersion": 1,
  "id": "zone-grove",
  "category": "environment",
  "status": "provisional",
  "comment": "THE ORB GROVE: the same dusk, deeper and denser — trees in clusters, spheres in bunches and drops of light that hang from the roof, with lava between the roots. What makes the zone that zone: the three seamless strips of its backdrop, tall enough for the camera of every room of it; the ground its rooms are built of; the pieces that stand, lie and hang in them; the spikes of its ditches; the lava, its fall and its embers; and the light in its colour. Painted by the generator in tools/art (npm run art:build), not by a person: provisional until an artist reviews or replaces it.",
